Z||000002||1FST2M6||01-17-2000||11:38 AM||||I had a RAM and a Centerforce and had nothing but problems with both of them. I'm now running a Beck/Arnley Pressure plate and ACT 4 Puck and shes kinda sticky but has made it nearly 4000 miles and i haven't had to replace it.. I beat the hell out of my clutch. I'm VERY happy with the BECK pressure plate! very smooth and easy to hold in traffic! unlike the CF-DF, or the RAM i had.. Although Centerforce did warranty the pressure plate!   Got the disc from <A HREF="http://www.clutchnet.com" TARGET=_blank>www.clutchnet.com</A>  and the Pressure plate from NAPA, along with the TO-bearing and new release fork! IT WAS IN STOCK !  (86 SE V6 4spd.)  ||||reg||1
